---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Gallery from "../components/Gallery.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Josh Rehders — Concert and Sports Photographer & Videographer"
  description="Josh Rehders is a concert and sports photographer & videographer based in New York City."
>

  <main>  
    <Header />
    <div class="about-container">
      <div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 25px;">Hey there, I'm Josh!</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>I'm an alumnus&nbsp;of&nbsp;Vanderbilt University, where I worked as&nbsp;the Photography Director at The Vanderbilt Hustler, and freelanced&nbsp;around the Nashville area. I now work at Microsoft in New York City as a Software Developer, and have continued working in the creative media space, capturing photo and video to document shows here in the city and nationwide.&nbsp;</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>I primarily shoot events in the electronic music space, for artists and venues of all sizes. I've worked with artists visiting my cities, as well as traveled to work with artists on tour to arrange coverage of events, create promotional photos, and cater to any photo/video content-related needs.&nbsp;</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="client-list">
            Some shows captured include:
            <br>- John Summit Hometown Shows (Popup, N1, Afters)
            <br>- Mau P at The Caverns
            <br>- Multiple artists at Arc Music Festival
            <br>- Various artists at Marathon Music Works in Nashville
            <br>- ALEX || RAYNE MUSIC at Lights on the Lawn Festival Nashville
            </p>
          </div>
        <div>
          <p>Over 500 of my photos have been used in published news outlets, including <a href="https://apnews.com/article/covid-politics-health-soccer-sports-3ea64a2321a9ce1eabc8d757140c0988" target="_blank">by the Associated Press</a>, <a href="https://time.com/6975991/campus-protests-student-photojournalists-cover-story/" target="_blank">TIME Magazine</a>, <a href="https://pressfreedomtracker.us/all-incidents/tennessee-reporter-arrested-while-covering-student-protest-against-israel-gaza-war/" target="_blank">U.S. Press Freedom Tracker</a>,&nbsp;as well as on televised&nbsp;segments of <a href="https://www.msnbc.com/morning-joe/watch/how-vanderbilt-university-balances-free-speech-and-safety-209688133888" target="_blank">MSNBC's Morning Joe</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href="https://www.goodmorningamerica.com/living/video/elite-athlete-opens-pressure-best-84052634" target="_blank">NBC's&nbsp;Good Morning America</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>If you're interested in coverage of a concert or event, live coverage of sports,&nbsp;or pursuing any other creative project, reach out to me via phone or email, and I'll get back to you quickly to discuss further!</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>
            Email: <a href="mailto:josh@rehders.photos" target="_self">josh@rehders.photos</a>
            <br>
            Phone: <a href="tel:832-405-8765" target="_self">832-405-8765</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

</Layout>
